==Restrictions==
===Chapter 1===
Max # of Deployable Cats: 10

===Chapter 2===
Max # of Deployable Cats: 15

===Chapter 3===
Max # of Deployable Cats: 20

==Battleground==
{{EnemiesAppearing|Dagshund|Zoge|Shibalien Elite}}
*4 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Shibalien Elite]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 2</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Dagshund|Zoge|UltraBaaBaa|Wild Doge}}
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*3 [[Zoge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[UltraBaaBaa]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*2 [[Wild Doge]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.

===<u>Chapter 3</u>===
{{EnemiesAppearing|Zoge|Znache|Zomboe|Mesocosmocyclone}}
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Mesocosmocyclone]] spawns as the boss after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mesocosmocyclone]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
The only major difference besides the restriction is that Dagshund is buffed to 200%, which doesn't make him any harder to stall. Cost-effective attackers like [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] will make quick work of the enemies.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Behemoths have arrived! The Wild Doges here will push very hard, so bring a Behemoth Slayer unit such as [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. If you don't own him, try to stall them with a few meatshields/tankers and use area attackers to fend them off. Make sure to bring a Barrier Breaker for the UltraBaaBaa.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
The Zombie enemies in this stage pose barely any threat and as such, your lineup should be solely focused on dealing with the Mesocosmocyclones. Anti-Alien units like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] and general damage dealers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] is all that's needed.

